{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15210200","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1521020001:1":{"text":"I never thought I'd meet people this kind in times like these...!","source_cn":"真……真没想到，这么艰难的时候还能遇到好心人……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD54B76FD05A6903","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521020002:0":{"text":"Yeah... ever since the drought and famine, we've had to trade everything just to eat. I haven't worn warm clothes like this in ages...","source_cn":"是啊……自从饥荒和干旱开始，我家的东西就全都拿去换食物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3CA19A9A9106D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521020003:0":{"text":"These aren't anything fancy. Just grabbed what I could from the warehouse.","source_cn":"这衣服不是很普通吗？我只是从库房里随便拿了几件。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F8A0A835AD24E68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521020004:0":{"text":"If more people need them, I'll find a way to bring one for every...","source_cn":"如果有很多人都需要的话，我应该可以给每个人都——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x670779E7D09923CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521020005:0":{"text":"*Cough*","source_cn":"……咳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34B517AEBE0D72A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521020006:0":{"text":"Huh? You sick too?","source_cn":"你干嘛咳嗽？也感冒了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885EA8181A02BA1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521020007:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog100>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95CDD3EF7C0AB622","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521020008:0":{"text":"Thank you for your kindness.","source_cn":"好孩子们，谢谢你们的好意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1519BF910F3CA739","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521020009:0":{"text":"Actually... Vailo and I, we've been thinking about leaving Halia.","source_cn":"其实……我和我丈夫瓦罗已经在考虑要不要离开呼临城了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F83153F5D479DF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521020010:0":{"text":"Leaving Halia? Why?!","source_cn":"离开呼临城？为什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB27F46B64A232E35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521020011:1":{"text":"Why? Just look around you.","source_cn":"这还用问吗？原因都摆在眼前了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9315246E64D3B60C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521020012:1":{"text":"First the drought, then famine, now floods and war. Our home's long gone. We've got nowhere left to stay.","source_cn":"先是干旱、饥荒，又是战争、洪水……我们的房子早就变卖了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC50CB7ED93DC0620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521020013:0":{"text":"Good thing we traded the house for food before the flood took it.","source_cn":"这还算是幸运的。至少在房子被冲塌之前，我们换来了一点口粮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x541CAACF24371A85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521020014:0":{"text":"And our son... he was sent off to war a while back. We haven't heard from him since.","source_cn":"还有我们的亲人……我们的孩子很早就被征召入伍。从那以后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF554AD20FCF418AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521020015:0":{"text":"Maybe he's already...","source_cn":"也许他早已经不在人世了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D5D6AAE4A61445C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521020016:0":{"text":"All that's left here is grief. We should have left a long time ago.","source_cn":"呼临城是个伤心地，我们早就该离开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7E572D010DEDC48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521020017:0":{"text":"But... where would you even go?","source_cn":"可是……可是离开呼临城以后，你们要去哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3D16B9700842DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521020018:0":{"text":"The nearest place is <style=\"highlight\">Tuttleton</style>. Is that where you're heading?","source_cn":"离这里最近的是<style=highlight>图塔镇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DE068F92C2FE227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521020019:0":{"text":"Tuttleton...?","source_cn":"图塔镇……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEAA8749A6B2E6DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521020020:0":{"text":"My teacher said even Tuttleton has suffered. No one's come to trade in a while.","source_cn":"我听老师说，图塔镇好像也发生了天灾……那里的居民都很久...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA028B9E921DCDD9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1521020021:0":{"text":"Suffered? Tuttleton? They're devout followers of the God of Harvest! No way they'd be cursed!","source_cn":"什么天灾！图塔镇那么虔诚地信仰丰饶神，怎么可能会遇到天灾？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A00DB9FBAE07444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1521020022:1":{"text":"If you ask me, this disaster is the <style=\"highlight\">God of Harvest's punishment</style>—because instead of a wise ruler, Halia let a clueless boy become the Regulus!","source_cn":"要我说，呼临城遇到的天灾才是<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5D567238F9F5574","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1521020023:0":{"text":"W–What do you mean? What's wrong with the Regulus?!","source_cn":"你……你在说什么？领主有什么问题？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB263CFFD8C1662D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1521020024:0":{"text":"Boy, the Regulus is about your age. You think someone like you could run a city like this?","source_cn":"孩子，领主的年纪应该和你差不多大，你觉得你能管理好这么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6BAEB9A9897D721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1521020025:0":{"text":"After the flood, did he come out and speak to the people? Did he even call the soldiers back to help?","source_cn":"洪水发生之后，领主有出面安抚过民众吗？他甚至都不舍得调...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x821B0105EAB12C09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1521020026:0":{"text":"I...","source_cn":"我……我……<key:dialog54>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD8A22398CEEA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:37:1521020026":{"text":"I...","source_cn":"我……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD8A22398CEEA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1521020027:0":{"text":"Why is the Regulus just a child?","source_cn":"为什么呼临城的领主会是一个小孩？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D87E81D571DC065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1521020028:1":{"text":"If people didn't support him, why didn't they choose someone else?","source_cn":"你们不喜欢他，为什么不换掉他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6B363F7A399222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1521020029:0":{"text":"Hah... he's the only child of <style=\"highlight\">Regulus Herennus</style>!","source_cn":"哼，谁让他是<style=highlight>赫伦尼殿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EB5D3CDD33148E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:42:1521020029":{"text":"Hah... he's the only child of <style=\"highlight\">Regulus Herennus</style>!","source_cn":"哼，谁让他是<style=highlight>赫伦尼殿下</style>唯一的孩子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EB5D3CDD33148E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1521020030:0":{"text":"You don't know about Regulus Herennus?! He founded Halia and led it through its early days.","source_cn":"你们连赫伦尼殿下都不知道？！他是呼临城的前任领主，也是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A767A2191111E97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1521020031:1":{"text":"He was wise and strong, good at leading armies, ruling fairly, and looking after the poor.","source_cn":"赫伦尼殿下英明威武，既能领兵出征，也有统治才能，连最困...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA1D69B8A84FECCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1521020032:0":{"text":"But he passed too soon, and left behind a young heir...","source_cn":"只可惜他去世得太早，只留下年幼的继承人……就是现在的领主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC820C61D5A86545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1521020033:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog101>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD55FCAA62AA39B8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1521020034:1":{"text":"During the famine, relief was scarce. The rations weren't enough, and people like me and Surah, those slower to arrive, got nothing.","source_cn":"城里闹饥荒的时候，城里几乎没有赈灾点，每天发放的食物也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF05F2512635F386E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1521020035:1":{"text":"Sure, Halia conquered Mirehold. But that wasn't Regulus Abundius, it was General Perseus. The Regulus just signed off on it.","source_cn":"没错，阿邦德登上领主之位后，呼临城攻下了交界地的水泽营...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1FD9AD2B7DA91EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1521020036:0":{"text":"And what did it cost? All our young people were sent to the front. Many of them never came back, including my son.","source_cn":"作为代价，城里的年轻人都被征兵走上前线了！我认识的许多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE05A9D6ABC23BC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:51:1521020036":{"text":"And what did it cost? All our young people were sent to the front. Many of them never came back, including my son.","source_cn":"作为代价，城里的年轻人都被征兵走上前线了！我认识的许多年轻人没再回来！甚至我自己的儿子——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE05A9D6ABC23BC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1521020037:1":{"text":"No, of course not. But if Regulus Herennus were still alive... things would be different.","source_cn":"我当然知道。但要是赫伦尼殿下还在，一切都会不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5245E79BEDF8134C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1521020038:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog102>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8CA570BBA14D4C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1521020039:0":{"text":"Enough, Vailo. You're scaring the boy.","source_cn":"好了，瓦罗，别再说了，你吓到这孩子了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE235278896629551","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1521020040:0":{"text":"My apologies, kind souls. Vailo's just... he hasn't been the same since we lost our son. Please don't mind his words.","source_cn":"抱歉，三位好心人。因为我们儿子的事，瓦罗一直心情不好…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00D7DF3EE52CA59D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1521020041:0":{"text":"That's alright...","source_cn":"没关系……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D6D000FD050CE67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1521020042:0":{"text":"I—I have to go. But please... don't leave Halia. Things will get better. I promise!","source_cn":"我、我还有事……再见。但是，希望你们不要离开呼临城……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3100DBCE8B363D84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1521020043:0":{"text":"He ran off. Should we <style=\"highlight\">go after him</style>?","source_cn":"他跑走了。要不要<style=highlight>追上...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFF691610BE55A554","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"He ran off. Should we <style=\"highlight\">go after him</style>?","female":"He ran off. Should we <style=\"highlight\">go after him</style>?","variant_male_record_index":"181690","variant_female_record_index":"181691","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:51:0:1":{"text":"You can't blame everything on a child.","source_cn":"这种事不能怪在一个小孩头上","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9FCD485482285EE6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You can't blame everything on a child.","female":"You can't blame everything on a child.","variant_male_record_index":"77426","variant_female_record_index":"77427","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:42:0:1":{"text":"Regulus Herennus?","source_cn":"赫伦尼是谁？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x59256D22193B8F13","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Regulus Herennus?","female":"Regulus Herennus?","variant_male_record_index":"77424","variant_female_record_index":"77425","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:37:0:1":{"text":"(Signal Abundius to keep quiet)","source_cn":"（阻止阿邦德说话）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC5DA3D72B16C6120","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Signal Abundius to keep quiet)","female":"(Signal Abundius to keep quiet)","variant_male_record_index":"77420","variant_female_record_index":"77421","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:37:1:2":{"text":"(Turn to Gala for help)","source_cn":"（示意加拉转移话题）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x47860E9EF75345B3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Turn to Gala for help)","female":"(Turn to Gala for help)","variant_male_record_index":"77422","variant_female_record_index":"77423","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:维比":{"text":"Vabin","source":"维比","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:苏拉":{"text":"Surah","source":"苏拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:领主阿邦德":{"text":"Abundius","source":"领主阿邦德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦罗":{"text":"Vailo","source":"瓦罗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":51,"localized_text_count":50,"speaker_count":5}}